 54	     * Evaluates one statement, carrying its variables and output into the context.
 55	     *
 56	     * The code is evaluated inline rather than through a helper, which is how
 57	     * k-kinzal/doctest-php does it and what makes carrying state work at all:
 58	     * variables an example defines land in this method's scope, so they are
 59	     * read back from here and this method's own locals are unset before the
 60	     * scope is handed on. A statement that raises leaves the context untouched.
 61	     */
